      "pText": "Jambore 5 is the bigger sibling of Jambore 3, built for children aged 5 to 12 who want more of a challenge. It keeps the Crazy Pink and Baby Blue circus colours but adds a spiral slide, trapeze bars on an arm that reaches out from the tower, and a climbing net. Play moves from climbing the net and ladder to hanging from the trapeze bars, then down the spiral slide. Its product area is 21'10\" x 18'7\", and it needs a safe play area of 27'10\" x 24'6\". That size suits a school ground or a society that already has toddler equipment and wants something for older children. Capacity is listed as 15. Jambore 5 is backed by a 3-year warranty on galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Ask us for a layout drawing."
